pympacds-gpio (0.1.1-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Depend on python3-pympacds >= 0.3.0 (uses health_status_dict()).
  * Require libgpiod v2: depend on python3-libgpiod (>= 2.0) (the previous
    python3-gpiod dependency does not exist; systems with libgpiod v1 need a
    separate GPIO service).

